s.length%3Bat%2B%3D1%29%7B%0A%20%20const%20kind%3DreadRequiredTextFact%28kinds%2Cat%29%2Cvalue%3DreadRequiredTextFact%28values%2Cat%29%3B%0A%20%20if%28%21closes.length%26%26kind%3D%3D%3D%27identifier%27%26%26value%3D%3D%3D%27let%27%29return%20at%3B%0A%20%20if%28kind%21%3D%3D%27punct%27%29continue%3B%0A%20%20if%28%21closes.length%26%26value%3D%3D%3D%27%7B%27%29return%20-1%3B%0A%20%20if%28value%3D%3D%3D%27%28%27%7C%7Cvalue%3D%3D%3D%27%5B%27%7C%7Cvalue%3D%3D%3D%27%7B%27%29closes%3Dcloses.concat%28%5Bvalue%3D%3D%3D%27%28%27%3F%27%29%27%3Avalue%3D%3D%3D%27%5B%27%3F%27%5D%27%3A%27%7D%27%5D%29%3B%0A%20%20else%20if%28value%3D%3D%3D%27%29%27%7C%7Cvalue%3D%3D%3D%27%5D%27%7C%7Cvalue%3D%3D%3D%27%7D%27%29%7B%0A%20%20%20if%28%21closes.length%7C%7CreadRequiredTextFact%28closes%2Ccloses.length-1%29%21%3D%3Dvalue%29return%20-1%3B%0A%20%20%20closes%3Dcloses.slice%280%2Ccloses.length-1%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%7D%0A%20return%20-1%3B%0A%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Postorder%20layers%20over%20the%20actual%20stages%3A%20zero%20Boolean%2C%20one%20pattern.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20forms%20%40returns%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20planConditionalChainLayers%28forms%29%7B%0A%20if%28forms.length%3C1%7C%7Cforms.length%3EreadConditionalChainStageLimit%28%29%29return%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%20let%20result%3D%5B%5D%2Cat%3Dforms.length%3B%0A%20while%28at%3E0%29%7Bat-%3D1%3Bconst%20form%3DreadRequiredNumberFact%28forms%2Cat%29%3Bif%28form%21%3D%3D0%26%26form%21%3D%3D1%29return%20%5B%5D%3Bresult%3Dresult.concat%28%5Bform%2Cat%5D%29%3B%7D%0A%20return%20result%3B%0A%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Unguarded%20coverage%20arm%20indices%2C%20then%20all%20actual%20arms%20in%20reverse%20order.%0A%20%2A%20A%20guarded%20arm%20never%20discharges%20exhaustiveness%20by%20itself.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20guards%20%40returns%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20planConditionalMatchArms%28guards%29%7B%0A%20if%28guards.length%3C1%7C%7Cguards.length%3EreadConditionalChainStageLimi